{"availability":"available","full":"SimonGSK/meridian-track-your-travels","name":"meridian-track-your-travels","description":"Meridian: an interactive 3D globe to mark the countries, states and cities you've visited, log flights as trips, look back on each year with a time-lapse, keep a wishlist, compare with a friend, and play 12 geography games. Installable, works offline. React, TypeScript, three.js.","category":"Education","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-29T21:27:37Z","updated":"2026-10-09T22:02:53Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://simongsk.github.io/meridian-track-your-travels/","topics":["flights","geography","geography-games","geography-quiz","globe","offline-first","pwa","react","threejs","travel","travel-map","travel-tracker","typescript","vite","webgl"],"demo":"https://simongsk.github.io/meridian-track-your-travels/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T22:06:30.130Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T22:06:30.130Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T22:06:30.130Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T22:06:30.130Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Three.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An interactive 3D globe for keeping track of where you've been. Mark the countries, states and cities you've visited and when, log your flights and see them grouped into trips, look back on each year or replay them all as a time-lapse, keep a wishlist, compare your travels with a friend's, and test your geography with twelve games.","Try it at It runs in any browser, on a phone too, can be installed as an app, and works offline. Everything you add stays in your browser."],"features":["Your travels: countries out of the world's 197, states and provinces (USA, Canada, Australia, Brazil), cities with pins, each visit by month with a note, a heat map by visits, a wishlist, and 58 achievements to earn.","Flights and trips: flights between 3,244 airports, drawn as arcs with little planes, and groupe